<!--
    ================================================================
    BANG MAU DEM "MUC DEM" (v5, 18/09/2026) - VIET LAI HOAN TOAN
    ================================================================

    Ban v4 chi ha sang bang mau ngay roi giam bao hoa: nhin ra van la
    "ban sang bi toi di", khong phai mot che do rieng. Ban nay doi CACH
    PHAN VAI cua mau, khong chi doi do sang:

      Ban SANG : giay kem, MUC navy, khoi vang/cam la mang nen.
      Ban DEM  : navy tro thanh CHINH NEN (nen la muc), chu la nga lanh,
                 vang chi con la mot vet nhan nho, va viec "bam duoc"
                 do mot mau LANH moi - tim oai huong - dam nhan.

    Vi sao tim oai huong (#A99BF0) cho thanh phan bam duoc:
      · Tren nen toi, vang va cam rung manh va hut mat lien tuc - dung
        thu nguoi ADHD de bi keo di. Tim lanh tra ve dung mot viec: "cai
        nay bam duoc".
      · No van thuoc ho mau cua logo (navy -> tim) nen khong lac bo.
      · Nguoi mu mau do-luc van phan biet duoc tim voi vang/cam.

    Bon tang be mat, sang dan deu (L = 0.007 / 0.012 / 0.021 / 0.033).
    Tren nen toi bong do gan nhu vo hinh, nen "cao hon" phai the hien
    bang SANG HON, giong cach Material Dark lam.

    Do tuong phan da do (WCAG 2.1):
        chu / nen          14.92     chu / the        13.63
        chu / the_2        12.03     chu / the_3      10.31
        chu_phu / nen       7.32     chu_phu / the     6.69
        chu_lien_ket / nen  7.58     nhan / nen       10.20
        chu_tren_nhan/nhan  9.93     cam / the         6.50

    Nen KHONG phai den tuyet doi (#000): chu trang tren den 21:1 lam net
    chu "loe" (halation) va moi mat khi nhin lau.
-->
